time, was it an anomaly?

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:53.190
Just thinking back to landscape,

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:56.100
I'm curious what your experience
was like at that point.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:59.580
- I was, well, at that
time I was the youngest,

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:03.334
I think the youngest ever was
Pat, I think Pat was like 22.

00:08:03.334 --> 00:08:05.970
