went through with her brain.

00:08:09.433 --> 00:08:12.693
I just, you can't imagine
or even fathom that.

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:16.170
But I think at the time I was the youngest

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:17.192
Division I head coach,

00:08:17.192 --> 00:08:20.820
and I was coming home to
Maine, I'm from Maine.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:23.793
And so that was an enormous
amount of pressure,

00:08:24.745 --> 00:08:26.337
to be in your home state.

00:08:26.337 --> 00:08:30.270
And some of that pressure
contributed to my, well,

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:33.060
