out that I was in fact

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.380
somebody with bipolar disorder.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.500
So I guess there's that awful experience,

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:39.300
but yet at the same time,

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:41.970
I believe in the concept
of the brilliant mind,

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:45.180
and I do believe that if you seek balance,

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:47.580
whatever balance you need to seek,

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.827
that you'll be your best ever,

00:08:49.827 --> 00:08:53.395
and so many people don't know
that they can get through it.

00:08:53.395 --> 00:08:54.750
- Yeah, I think that's really well said.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.130
Definitely something I
want us to come back to

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:57.180
