00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:09.270
but the idea of separating mental health

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.640
from mental wellness, and this idea

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:14.760
that you don't have to be,
you can have a mental illness

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:16.800
and still have mental wellness.

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.240
- Mm, absolutely yeah.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.860
- And at the same time, you
cannot have a mental illness

00:09:19.860 --> 00:09:21.120
and not have mental wellness,

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.770
in terms of the day-to-day activities,

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:23.850
how people are spending their time.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:27.240
So really helping us as a
society to think about things

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:30.150
that way, and not to just put
those of us who are struggling

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:32.910
into a specific category of condemnation,

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:34.860
or struggling, or hopelessness,

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.840
but to really have that peace.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.400
And that's one of the things
I've really appreciated

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:41.160
with what you've been sharing with folks

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.510
as well on this journey.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:44.430
- Well, it's as you know,

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:46.920
and of course I'm preaching
to the choir here,

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:49.050
but it's a continuum.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:51.510
And what I feel about the continuum

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:53.160
is it's become much more blurred,

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:57.570
and now whatever was good
for me back in the day,

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.780
and I realized bipolar
disorder might be 5%,

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.410
I don't know, we don't know
'cause many are undiagnosed,

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:06.570
but let's say five, 4 percent.

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:11.570
The reality is my ability
to relate is a 100%,

00:10:11.928 --> 00:10:13.410
with what we've been through.

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:15.840
And so sharing tips and ideas,

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.920
whether it's a simple
tip about sleep hygiene,

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:22.230
or something more complicated CBT,

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:25.290
